      "y": 0,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "# Google WeatherNext 3\n\n- Google DeepMind / Research\n- `gs://weathernext3_spatial`\n- Zarr 5km / 10km horario global\n- Autorizado: dnieves@unal.edu.co",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "1000000000000002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -120,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "# Ingesta Zarr & Slicing\n\n- `scripts/collect_wn3.py`\n- xarray + gcsfs / obstore\n- Recorte por bounding box regional\n- Descargas atómicas a staging",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "1000000000000003",
